WEBVTT

00:04:30.725 --> 00:04:32.893
So we have to create a new team.

00:04:32.935 --> 00:04:35.813
I believe we should create
what I call the GERM team.

00:04:36.188 --> 00:04:41.819
Germ stands for Global Epidemic
Response and Mobilization.

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:44.530
This group is full-time.

00:04:44.572 --> 00:04:47.908
Their only priority
is pandemic prevention.

00:04:48.451 --> 00:04:50.953
It's made up of a diverse
set of specialists

00:04:50.953 --> 00:04:54.165
with a lot of different
realms of expertise:

00:04:54.206 --> 00:04:57.668
epidemiologists, data scientists,

00:04:57.710 --> 00:04:59.378
logistics experts.

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:01.881
And it's not just scientific
and medical knowledge.